### Search API Test Script
### 포트 8087에서 실행 중인 애플리케이션 테스트

### 1. Health Check - Elasticsearch 연결 확인
GET http://localhost:8087/api/health/elasticsearch
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Health Check - Database 연결 확인  
GET http://localhost:8087/api/health/database
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. 데이터 동기화 - 모든 데이터
POST http://localhost:8087/api/search/admin/sync/all
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 4. 데이터 동기화 - 유저만
POST http://localhost:8087/api/search/admin/sync/users
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 5. 데이터 동기화 - 프로젝트만
POST http://localhost:8087/api/search/admin/sync/projects
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 6. 유저 검색 - 전체
GET http://localhost:8087/api/search/users
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. 유저 검색 - 닉네임으로
GET http://localhost:8087/api/search/users?nickname=testuser1
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. 유저 검색 - 기술 파트로
GET http://localhost:8087/api/search/users?techPart=Backend
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. 유저 검색 - 기술 스택으로
GET http://localhost:8087/api/search/users?techStacks=Java&techStacks=Spring
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. 프로젝트 검색 - 전체
GET http://localhost:8087/api/search/projects
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. 프로젝트 검색 - 프로젝트명으로
GET http://localhost:8087/api/search/projects?projectName=테스트
Accept: application/json

###

### 12. 프로젝트 검색 - 기술 스택으로
GET http://localhost:8087/api/search/projects?techStacks=Spring&techStacks=React
Accept: application/json

###

### 13. 프로젝트 검색 - 필요 기술 파트로
GET http://localhost:8087/api/search/projects?requiredTechParts=Backend
Accept: application/json

###

### 14. 통합 검색 - 전체
GET http://localhost:8087/api/search/unified?keyword=test
Accept: application/json

###

### 15. 통합 검색 - 유저만
GET http://localhost:8087/api/search/unified?keyword=testuser&searchType=user
Accept: application/json

###

### 16. 통합 검색 - 프로젝트만
GET http://localhost:8087/api/search/unified?keyword=프로젝트&searchType=project
Accept: application/json

###

### 17. 통합 검색 - 기술 스택 필터 적용
GET http://localhost:8087/api/search/unified?keyword=개발&techStacks=Java&techStacks=Spring
Accept: application/json

###